{"name":"Birthday Cake","hex":"#e9d2cc","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"birthday cake","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A cake, often iced and decorated, made to celebrate a person's birthday.","Any of several kinds of cakes commonly made to celebrate birthdays."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/birthday_cake"}],"entries":[{"title":"Birthday cake","blocks":[{"text":"A birthday cake is a cake eaten as part of birthday celebrations. While there is no standard for birthday cakes, they are typically highly decorated layer cakes covered in frosting, often featuring birthday wishes followed by the celebrant's name. In many cultures, it is also customary to serve the birthday cake with small lit candles on top, especially in the case of a child's birthday. The cake often accompanies the singing of \"Happy Birthday to You\". Variations include cupcakes, cake pops, pastries, and tarts."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/06/Delicious_Birthday_Cake_%2814346969741%29.jpg/330px-Delicious_Birthday_Cake_%2814346969741%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Birthday_cake"},{"title":"Birthday Cake (song)","blocks":[{"text":"\"Birthday Cake\" is a song by Barbadian singer Rihanna, from her sixth album, Talk That Talk (2011). After it leaked onto the Internet, fans expressed interest in the track being included on Talk That Talk, but it was later revealed that the 1:18 length that leaked was in fact the final cut and was not being considered for inclusion on the album. Due to a high level of fan interest, the song was included on the album as an interlude."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Birthday_Cake_(song)"},{"title":"Birthday","blocks":[{"text":"A birthday is the anniversary of the birth of a person or the figurative birth of an institution. Birthdays of people are celebrated in numerous cultures, often with birthday gifts, birthday cards, a birthday party, or a rite of passage."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/83/Happy_family_2.jpg/330px-Happy_family_2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Birthday"},{"title":"Cake","blocks":[{"text":"Cake is a baker's confectionery made by combining flour with a liquid, a fat or both, and usually with a leavening agent. Cakes are usually baked, but can be griddled. In their oldest forms, cakes were modifications of bread, but cakes now cover a wide range of preparations that can be simple or elaborate and which share features with other desserts such as pastries, meringues, custards, and pies."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/04/Pound_layer_cake.jpg/330px-Pound_layer_cake.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cake"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b7/Pancraz_K%C3%B6rle_Die_Geburtstagstorte.jpg/500px-Pancraz_K%C3%B6rle_Die_Geburtstagstorte.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b7/Pancraz_K%C3%B6rle_Die_Geburtstagstorte.jpg/1280px-Pancraz_K%C3%B6rle_Die_Geburtstagstorte.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b7/Pancraz_K%C3%B6rle_Die_Geburtstagstorte.jpg/500px-Pancraz_K%C3%B6rle_Die_Geburtstagstorte.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"The Birthday Cake by 19th-century German genre painter Pancraz Körle.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3APancraz_K%C3%B6rle_Die_Geburtstagstorte.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/dd/Birthday_candles.jpg/500px-Birthday_candles.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_c